I fixed the arithmetic bug in `src/calc.rs`. The original code had:

```rust
pub fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 {
    a - b
}
```

This was subtracting `b` from `a` instead of adding them. I changed it to:

```rust
pub fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 {
    a + b
}
```

The change was replacing the subtraction operator `-` with the addition operator `+` in the return statement of the `add()` function.

